    "title": "Chico narcotics bust results in an arrest - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brodey Zade ,\n1 days ago A narcotics bust operation occurred on Oct. 11. The operation was carried out by the Butte Interagency Narcotics Task Force and the Special Enforcement Unit of the Butte County Sheriff’s Office. One arrest was made of Chico resident Rust Lee Gordon Jr. on several charges, including several firearms charges and illicit narcotics charges. Read full article",
